  "text": "proprium.transfiguratio-domini-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Transfiguration of Our Lord” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Hallow our offerings, we beseech You, O Lord, through the glorious Transfiguration of Your only-begotten Son, and cleanse us from the stains of our sins by the light of that same revelation. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
